⚡️🇺🇸🇮🇷 It was more like a love hug than a love tap this time. CENTCOM announced striking over 80 Iranian targets around the Strait of Hormuz. Both targets at land at at sea were targeted. Especially notable are claims that command-and-control networks and over 60 IRGC Navy fast attack crafts were struck.

IRGC's Khatim al-Anbiya HQ has announced a response is coming, and drones are already being launched towards the Fifth Fleet headquarters in Bahrain.

